abstract: "Research data for DG-CGMOEA, a dynamic graph and constraint-guided multi-objective evolutionary algorithm for construction site layout planning. The dataset contains 465 comparison runs across 25 projects, attained objective fronts, project-paired effects and statistical tests, noise-source sensitivity results for 948 fixed layouts, and a canteen planning case with 47 feasible Pareto alternatives."
